# Descartados: vinifmor/bauh (abandonado 0.10.7
# Ene-2024, foro CachyOS pide removerlo), Discover (sin AUR por diseno,
# PackageKit lock, desaconsejado ArchWiki). Nota: Seafoam-Labs/Shelly-ALPM
# reevaluar en 6 meses. Upstream tienda: https://github.com/manjaro/pamac.
# Post-install (Task5/calamares): flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists flathub
# https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
# --- extra ---
# pamac-aur: tienda unica (binario del repo local [nimbus]; libpamac-aur
